<title>USA: Sigma, Continental end talks.</title>
<headline>Sigma, Continental end talks.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA CLARA, Calif 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sigma Circuits Inc said its letter of intent to merge with Continental Circuits Corp has expired and merger discussions between the two companies have been terminated by mutual agreement.</p>
<p>Sigma said while the potential combination of our two companies remains strategically sound, they were unable to come to agreement on several key points necessary to move forward to a definitive agreement.  As a result, Sigma has decided to remain independent for the time being.&quot;</p>
</text>
